  "description": "Read, write, calculate, template and render Word, Excel and PowerPoint documents (OOXML, legacy binary, RTF, ODF) in pure .NET. Not affiliated with Microsoft. Spreadsheets for OneDocument: open, edit and save XLSX, XLSM, XLTX, XLSB and Flat OPC workbooks with untouched parts kept byte-identical, read XLS and write BIFF8 XLS, read and write CSV and TSV, stream rows and cells at constant memory, and calculate formulas; styles, number formats, tables, conditional formatting, data validation, defined names and pivots.",
